    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Grossly, the tumour is well circumscribed, with a tan, fleshy, multilobular cut surface.</p>",
    "source": "<p>Elizabeth H. Cheek, M.H.S, PA (ASCP) Cheek.Elizabeth@mayo.edu</p>",
