    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Solitary fibrous tumour",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Fat-forming (lipomatous) solitary fibrous tumour shows typical features of solitary fibrous tumour with areas of mature adipose tissue or scattered adipocytes.</p>",
    "source": "Elizabeth G. Demicco",
    "copyright": "",
