    "diagnosis": "<p>Solitary fibrous tumour</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Immunohistochemical expression of STAT6 is characteristic of the neoplastic cells of solitary fibrous tumour. Only strong and diffuse nuclear staining should be considered positive. </p>",
